_name": "4.png", "id": "3133652316909922", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982689_3133652320243255_4869908892482827573_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oB0zEUljeTQQ7kNvwHuhhPB&_nc_oc=AdqqSv4w3S7sHqDZ4oSuZT7e0Afu6wysz9LsAr9Hc8SIMSSuchLps4PsiphF030HnCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGWCCd_vzFuTb6QEWVXFeTMO8-wK8xTtPo9YITyon0iyw&oe=6A8D7ED8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Cover Image.png", "id": "269398401815424", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75356794_269398405148757_4001608527998605695_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rS5qUnf1JFYQ7kNvwHoXz5W&_nc_oc=AdrFvI9rlwZKvllspy2O267AOg3xXznNrKRW5xNkYBhmEVgiPe82K1TLxbJhB6ToP-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF-uoDZybsCsaz5GH4AXdUK-epmfcmAzBZRMPZn9f7P4Q&oe=6A8D7C6B"}, "display_name": "Ethereal Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ethereal Land is a unique meditation application of oriental ink painting style. \nIn this poetic world, you will:\n- Experience the changes of seasons\n- Discover inner peace in a relaxing mindfulness journey\n- Immerse yourself in the ink painting scenery\n\nOur goal is to bring you a new visual meditation experience. Through breathing training, awareness practice and mindful escape,  you may find your own ethereal land.", "short_description": "Ethereal Land is a unique meditation application of oriental ink painting style. \nIn this poetic world, you will:\n- Experience the changes of seasons\n- Discover inner peace in a relaxing mindfulness journey\n- Immerse yourself in the ink painting scenery\n\nOur goal is to bring you a new visual meditation experience. Through breathing training, awareness practice and mindful escape,  you may find your own ethereal land."}]}, "developer_name": "SFS Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://shufeishu.com/ethereal-land/Privacy_Policy_202202